# Root context is used by the keycloak Dockerfile (COPYs the realm export from
# docker/keycloak/) and by the move-analysis build (which gets the Stockfish
# sources as an extra `stockfish=./stockfish` context). The Keycloak
# distribution directories are the only genuinely heavy parts; the data dir
# (realm export) stays in the context so the keycloak image can COPY it.
.git/
.idea/
*.iml
**/target/
chess-web/
kafka_2.13-4.4.0/
kafka_2.13-4.4.0.tgz
keycloak-21.1.1/lib/
keycloak-21.1.1/bin/
.stockfish/
.logs/
.env
